 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Try a quiet room, close doors and a window, turn down the volume at night, and use ear plugs if it still bothers. Stand in the kitchen at night and see how loud it is outside. Somewhere quiet might surprise you. Then ask a neighbour if they can move you to a different room, or rent sound proof box. It' worth asking someone before it's an emergency. Keep the doors open and use a box if needed. Good plan. Echoes really build up in small rooms, especially with voice tones.",
